  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of what **FedEx.com** offers, particularly related to **FedEx Express** services:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude9a FedEx Express \u2013 Key Highlights\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 What You Can Do on FedEx.com\nYou can use FedEx.com to log in to your FedEx account, get your tracking status, find a FedEx location near you, learn more about how to become a better shipper, get online print offers, or get inspiration for your small business needs.\n\n---\n\n### \u26a1 Expedited & Express Shipping\nExpedited shipping is a fast method for sending priority shipments that must reach their destination by a specific deadline, whether it's across town or on a global scale. This fast shipping service accommodates a range of items, from individual envelopes and packages to palletized freight.\n\nDelivery options can be selected to ensure items are delivered as fast as the same day. For businesses, choosing expedited shipping can help increase conversions and loyalty from customers who expect fast delivery.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf0d International Shipping\nFedEx allows you to expand your reach to 130+ countries and territories. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe0 FedEx Home Delivery\nUse **FedEx Home Delivery** to ship to someone's house or apartment, and FedEx Ground to ship to businesses.\n\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers within **1\u20135 days**, every day of the week, including Saturday and Sunday (excluding Hawaii and Alaska).\n\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers packages **150 lbs. or less** to residences every day of the week, with a **$5.95 residential surcharge** applied per package.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Flat-Rate Shipping with FedEx One Rate\u00ae\nWith **FedEx One Rate\u00ae**, you get flat-rate, 2-day shipping for packages up to 50 lbs.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf81 FedEx Rewards\nWhen you join **FedEx Rewards**, the extras start immediately \u2014 you'll get a **$10 gift card** for your first eligible shipment. Open a FedEx account to get started.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udccd Track Your Package\nYou can enter your FedEx tracking number, track by reference, obtain proof of delivery, or use a TCN \u2014 covering FedEx Express, Ground, Freight, and Custom Critical tracking services.\n\n---\n\nFor full details, you can visit \ud83d\udc49 **[www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html)** or go directly to the Express shipping page at **[fedex.com/en-us/shipping/express](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/shipping/express.html)**.",
